JPEG, GIF and WebP conformance images
-------------------------------------

Every image here is a synthetic picture drawn by tools/codec_reference.py
from a fixed seed and encoded with Pillow 12.3 (libjpeg-turbo, Pillow's GIF
writer, libwebp 1.6.0). Each *.rgba file is the RGBA8 decode of the image of
the same name by Pillow, with EXIF orientation applied for JPEG and every
composited frame concatenated for animations. MANIFEST lists
"file width height frames tolerance" per image. Nothing was downloaded; the
images are released with the repository.
